{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“谷山–志村猜想”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"谷山–志村猜想"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>谷山–志村猜想的大意是说每个有理"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆曲线","text":"椭圆曲线"}},{"Plain":"都来自"},{"Local":{"url":"模形式","text":"模形式"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>表述</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbb{Q}$ 上的椭圆曲线都可由某个级数 $N$ 的经典模曲线 $X_0(N)$ 经过一个整系数的有理映射得到, 称之为 $N$ 级的模参数化 (modular parametrization).</li>\n<li>对任意有理椭圆曲线 $y^2= Ax^3 + Bx^2+ Cx+ D$, 存在 $N$ 级的非常值模函数 $f(z),g(z)$, 使得 $f(z)^2 = A g(z)^2 + C g(z) + D$ (也即有同样的 Dirichlet L-级数).</li>\n<li>设有理椭圆曲线 $E$ 有导子 $N_E$, 则存在尖点形式 $f$ 使得 $a_1(f)=1$, 且对所有素数 $p$ 有 $a_p(f)=a_p(E)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>与 Langlands 对应的关系</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Taniyama conjecture says that the L-series of an elliptic curve over Q is automorphic (more specifically, arises from a modular form). Langlands conjectures that every L-series arising from algebraic geometry is automorphic (in the sense he defined).</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Langlands对应","text":"Langlands 对应"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}